    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d612">

                <pb facs="0808" n="720" xml:id="pg720"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">871.48/89: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the Chargé in France</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Bliss</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi>
                        </placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1919-01-13T19:00:00-05:00"
                            >January 13, 1919—7 p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>6947. For Davis from Rathbone. Treasury 701. Supplementing our 688.<anchor n="78"
                        xml:id="d612-f1"/> President’s message number 215 January 9, 5 p.m. has been
                    received, which we regard as sufficient to authorize use of credits in favor of
                    Roumania which President has heretofore approved. We now await necessary advices
                    from State Department in order that requirements of act of Congress shall be
                    observed.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Polk</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d612-f1" n="78" xml:id="d612-f1-content">
                <p>Telegram No. 6879, Jan. 7, 1919, 3 p.m., from the Acting Secretary of State, <ref
